\code{GWmodel} 2.4-1 in the cross-check tests. The k convention and the boxcar
boundary are EarthFlux conventions (GW-03). AICc: see
\code{\link[=ef_gwr_bandwidth]{ef_gwr_bandwidth()}}. Local R2 (weighted mean of the local fit, GW-13),
tr(S'S), 2 tr(S) - tr(S'S), edf and the condition number: \code{CANDIDATA}.
Original attributions (Brunsdon et al., 1996; Fotheringham et al., 2002)
not read.
